              <option value="harmonic">Natural Overtone Series (1..12)</option>
            </select>
            <label class="kv">Root Hz:</label>
            <input id="rootHz" type="number" value="220" min="55" max="880" style="width:74px">
            <button id="btnPlrP">Tonnetz P</button>
            <button id="btnPlrL">Tonnetz L</button>
            <button id="btnPlrR">Tonnetz R</button>
          </div>
          <div id="padGrid" class="tonnetz"></div>
          <div class="kv" style="margin-top:8px" id="scaleInfo">
            Active triad: <b>C maj (0,4,7)</b> · Arnold-tongue Farey width: <b>1/(p·q)</b> · Click pads or play keyboard/MIDI.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>Polyrhythm &amp; Euclidean Wheel (lib/resonance balance-canonical)</h2>
          <div class="row">
            <label class="kv">Voice A E(k,n):</label>
            <input id="eucK1" type="number" value="3" min="1" max="16" style="width:52px">
            <input id="eucN1" type="number" value="8" min="2" max="16" style="width:52px">
            <label class="kv">Voice B E(k,n):</label>
            <input id="eucK2" type="number" value="5" min="1" max="16" style="width:52px">
            <input id="eucN2" type="number" value="12" min="2" max="16" style="width:52px">
            <button id="btnApplyEuc">Load Into Seq</button>
          </div>
          <canvas id="polyCanvas" width="600" height="190"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Physical Wave Machine &amp; Excitation (Zero Presets)</h2>
          <div class="row">
            <select id="topoSel">
              <option value="string">1D Chain (Plucked / Bowed String)</option>
              <option value="plate">2D 4×4 Mesh (Drumhead / Plate · HyperNet-16)</option>
              <option value="room">3D Coupled Chamber (Physical Cathedral Reverb)</option>
              <option value="fhn">Nonlinear FHN / Duffing (Analog Saturation)</option>
              <option value="petersen">Non-Euclidean Petersen Graph (Impossible Gong)</option>
            </select>
            <select id="excSel">
              <option value="pluck">Pluck (Displacement)</option>
              <option value="hammer">Piano Hammer (Momentum)</option>
              <option value="bow">Bowed (Stick-Slip Friction)</option>
              <option value="reed">Brass / Reed Valve</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="slider-row"><span>Stiffness k</span><input id="slK" type="range" min="0.02" max="0.85" step="0.005" value="0.24"><span id="vK">0.240</span></div>
          <div class="slider-row"><span>Coupling w</span><input id="slW" type="range" min="0.00" max="0.48" step="0.005" value="0.22"><span id="vW">0.220</span></div>
          <div class="slider-row"><span>Damping γ</span><input id="slG" type="range" min="0.0002" max="0.04" step="0.0002" value="0.0024"><span id="vG">0.0024</span></div>
          <div class="slider-row"><span>Nonlinearity α</span><input id="slA" type="range" min="0.00" max="0.60" step="0.01" value="0.06"><span id="vA">0.06</span></div>
          <div class="slider-row"><span>Modal Cross-Synth</span><input id="slM" type="range" min="0.00" max="1.00" step="0.01" value="0.25"><span id="vM">0.25</span></div>
          <canvas id="scopeCanvas" width="520" height="140" style="margin-top:8px"></canvas>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>Perpetually Live Branching Jam DAG (Coherent Cones)</h2>
          <div class="row">
            <input id="roomIn" type="text" value="hyper-jam-01" style="width:140px">
            <button id="btnJoinRoom" class="ok">Join / Sync Room</button>
            <button id="btnForkBranch">+ Fork Branch From Selected</button>
            <button id="btnTip">Tip Active Cone (+10 cr)</button>
          </div>
          <div id="jamDagList"></div>
          <div class="kv" id="creditLog">Dual Credit (lib/credit conserved): <b>100</b> held · <b>0</b> in-flight · sample+wave provenance active.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PANE 2: TIMELINE, WAVELET SPECTRUM & DTW BATTLE -->
  <div id="p2" class="pane">
    <div class="grid2">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>16-Step Rational Sequencer &amp; Non-Destructive Audio I/O</h2>
          <div class="kv">Track 1 — Bass (Root C0, 1:1)</div>
          <div id="seqRow0" class="step-grid"></div>
          <div class="kv">Track 2 — Harmonic Voice (3:2 / 5:4)</div>
          <div id="seqRow1" class="step-grid"></div>
          <div class="kv">Track 3 — 2D Membrane Percussion</div>
          <div id="seqRow2" class="step-grid"></div>
          <div class="row" style="margin-top:10px">
            <button id="btnExportWav" class="primary">Export 48kHz WAV (4s)</button>
            <button id="btnExportMid">Export .MID</button>
            <label class="badge" style="cursor:pointer">Import WAV/MID <input id="fileIn" type="file" accept=".wav,.mid,.midi" style="display:none"></label>
            <button id="btnWaveletBench">Run Bit-Exact Haar Wavelet + Δ Bench</button>
          </div>
          <div id="ioLog" class="mono-box">Ready. Exports deterministic 48kHz 16-bit PCM WAV directly from the Port-Hamiltonian engine.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>Exact Reversible Haar Lifting Wavelet Subbands (Low-Pass s / Detail d)</h2>
          <canvas id="waveletCanvas" width="600" height="170"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Witnessed DTW · Russian-Method Piano / Rhythm Battle (sound/time)</h2>
          <div class="kv" style="margin-bottom:8px">
            Tap pads, press keys, or play MIDI along with the target score. Computes exact monotone <b>WarpPath</b>, per-note ms rush/drag residual, deterministic SHA-256 battle proof, and 1-click <b>Groove Transfer</b>.
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <button id="btnRecTake" class="primary">Record Live Take</button>
            <button id="btnSimTake">Simulate Human Take</button>
            <button id="btnRunDtw">Compute Witnessed DTW</button>
            <button id="btnGrooveXfer">Transfer Groove WarpPath → Seq</button>
          </div>
          <canvas id="dtwCanvas" width="520" height="190" style="margin-bottom:8px"></canvas>
          <div id="dtwOut" class="mono-box">Target score (ms): [0, 250, 500, 750, 1000, 1250, 1500, 1750]
Record a take or click Simulate Human Take to inspect the exact WarpPath witness.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PANE 3: PHYSICAL WAVE MESH & ZERO-TAPE INVERSE DESIGN -->
  <div id="p3" class="pane">
    <div class="grid2">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Interactive Port-Hamiltonian Wave Mesh &amp; Live Wavefield (Click Nodes to Excite / Drag Stiffness)</h2>
          <canvas id="meshCanvas" width="600" height="360"></canvas>
          <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
            <button id="btnExciteAll">Strike Center Node</button>
            <button id="btnCoupleRoom">Couple Bridge Edge (L_A ⊕ L_B)</button>
            <button id="btnResetMesh">Zero Energy (q=0, p=0)</button>
          </div>
          <div class="kv">Proved in <b>sound/wave.hypercubical</b>: <code>wave-edge-psd-id</code> ($x^T L x = \sum w_{ij}(x_i-x_j)^2 \ge 0$), <code>wave-passivity-sos-id</code> ($\Delta E = -\Delta t \gamma s_v^2 \le 0$), <code>wave-hadamard4-norm-id</code>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Zero-Tape O(1)-Memory Reversible Verlet Inverse Physical Design</h2>
          <div class="kv" style="margin-bottom:8px">
            Uses exact algebraic time-reversibility (<code>verlet-inv (verlet-fwd s) ≡ s</code>, zero stored activation tape!) to solve for physical stiffness <b>k</b> matching any target pitch or live hummed frequency.
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <label class="kv">Target Hz:</label>
            <input id="invHz" type="number" value="330" min="80" max="1200" style="width:80px">
            <button id="btnInvSolve" class="primary">Solve Mesh Stiffness (Zero-Tape)</button>
            <button id="btnInvApply">Apply Solved k to Live Engine</button>
          </div>
          <canvas id="invCanvas" width="520" height="200" style="margin-bottom:8px"></canvas>
          <div id="invLog" class="mono-box">Idle. Click "Solve Mesh Stiffness" to run reversible Verlet forward/inverse adjoint steps.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PANE 4: REFLECTION, LIVE-CODING DSL, CAS & CRYPTOGRAPHIC WARRANTS -->
  <div id="p4" class="pane">
    <div class="grid2">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Live .hypercubical Pattern &amp; Wave Reflection (Bidirectional Sync)</h2>
          <textarea id="codeBuf">-- Live checked Hyperactive Sound term (edits update audio kernel immediately!)
-- Pattern algebra from sound/time.hypercubical + mesh4-step from sound/wave.hypercubical
